Note on the prompt assets:
The agent prompt templates and reference text assets used in the published
study are held privately at `prompts/` (gitignored). This separation is for
target-leakage prevention, not licensing — the prompts themselves, when
released to the corresponding author upon request, are also covered by this
MIT License.
